The '''Neutrino''' is one of the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Treasure]]s. Like the [[Philosopher's Stone]], which it stacks with, it increases the amount of XP earned from [[Battle|battles]], but its effect is much smaller.

==Effect==
Each Neutrino increases XP awarded by a maximum +25%.

When a player has activated Neutrino at 100% in all three chapters, XP awarded is increased by +75%.

