==Trivia==
*In spite of being listed 10th in the Treasure Menu, the Neutrino is actually the 11th and last obtainable Cats of the Cosmos Treasure.
*The image for this treasure resembles the interior of [[wikipedia:Super-Kamiokande|Super-Kamiokande]], a neutrino observatory in Japan.

